Date: October 14, 2026

## Key Concepts

- n8n is a tool for building automated workflows.
- Workflows connect different apps and services together.
- Many workflows can run without much code.
- Automation can save a lot of time on repeated tasks.
- AI can be added into a workflow.
- Workflows can also connect to databases, email, Slack, Discord, and other services.
- Human-in-the-loop means a person still approves something before the workflow continues.
- Automation is useful, but giving AI too much control can cause problems.

## What is n8n?

n8n is a workflow automation tool.

Instead of writing a full program, you connect different steps together like blocks. Each block can do something different, such as reading an email, sending data to AI, updating a database, or sending a message.

The main goal is to automate work that would normally have to be done by hand.

