## Real-World Applications

* Automating emails and replies.
* Sending information between different apps.
* Connecting AI to a local model.
* Reading and updating databases.
* Moderating Discord or other chat systems.
* Creating business workflows without building a full program.
* Using a person to approve AI decisions before they are completed.

